ARMJIT: jit.stats, a debug readout of blocks, exits and links (BananaDS J6)

MELONDS_JIT_STATS=N: a "[jit] stats" log line every N frames. Off (default): nothing counted, the exit stubs
are emitted byte for byte as before. The emulation never reads the counters.

